// Copy to Secrets.xcconfig (gitignored) and fill in.
//
//     cp Config/Secrets.example.xcconfig Config/Secrets.xcconfig
//
// WC_API_KEY must match the API_KEY set on the server:
//
//     the API_KEY variable on the Railway service
//
// This value ends up inside the app binary and is extractable with `strings`.
// That is an accepted tradeoff here — one user, no accounts, no multi-tenancy,
// never on the App Store, and spec.md chose a shared secret deliberately. Two
// rules follow from it: never reuse CRON_SECRET as the API key (it must never
// ship in the binary), and rotating API_KEY means shipping a new build.

WC_API_KEY = paste-the-server-API_KEY-here
